    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44537" root="&#xA;                        ورى&#xA;                    " body-key="w1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرَى</span></b> 
                        , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرِى</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرْىٌ</span> [and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُرِىٌّ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِيَةٌ</span>, K]; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرِىَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَرِى</span>; and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْرَى</span></b> ; <i>It</i>
(a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْد</span>) <i>produced its fire.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرِيَتْ بِكَ</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَادِى</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرَتْ</span>: see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زند</span>, and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَقَدَ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَهَرَ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">راى</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَدْحٌ لَا يُورِى</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيَّابٌ</span>.

